Bundled electrode-montage source templates
==========================================

The files in this directory are unmodified reference electrode templates
redistributed from MNE-Python, used here solely as the source geometry from
which the bundled spherical montage CSVs (in the parent directory) are
generated by `_generate.py`.

They are provided for reproducibility: anyone can regenerate the shipped CSVs
from these templates with `python -m spherical_eeg_sim.montages._generate`.

Source
------
MNE-Python, tag v1.7.0, path `mne/channels/data/montages/`:
  https://github.com/mne-tools/mne-python/tree/v1.7.0/mne/channels/data/montages

  standard_1005.elc, standard_1020.elc   -- 10-20/10-10/10-05 system
                                            (Oostenveld & Praamstra, 2001)
  biosemi16/32/64/128/256.txt            -- BioSemi cap layouts
  GSN-HydroCel-32/64/128/256/257.sfp     -- EGI/Philips Geodesic Sensor Net
  EGI_256.csd                            -- EGI 256 (same net as GSN-HydroCel-256)

The 10-20/10-10/10-05 coordinates follow Oostenveld, R. & Praamstra, P. (2001),
"The five percent electrode system for high-resolution EEG and ERP measurements",
Clinical Neurophysiology 112(4):713-719. See also Jurcak, V., Tsuzuki, D. &
Dan, I. (2007), NeuroImage 34(4):1600-1611.

